OL,3,GNEWSADad group attracts 100 members
OL,4,Abefore launch
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 dads have signed up for a
OL,7,Fman's support group, despite the fact
OL,8,Fhe has not planned its first official
OL,9,Fevent yet.
OL,11,FMatt Krishnan-Bird founded the Good
OL,12,FDads Club in Colchester, Essex, in
OL,13,FSeptember last year, before expanding
OL,14,Fit to Chelmsford earlier this year,
OL,15,Fafter noticing a lack of support groups
OL,16,Fspecifically for dads.
OL,18,FAfter the success of both groups, one
OL,19,Fof his Colchester members asked him if
OL,20,Fhe would consider launching a group in
OL,21,FIpswich, which he agreed to, and they
OL,22,Fare planning the first event.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
