OL,3,GNEWSADad group attracts 100 members
OL,4,Abefore launch
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlready they have seen significant
OL,7,Fdemand in Ipswich, and with the three
OL,8,Fgroups, Krishnan-Bird has 500 dads
OL,9,Finvolved. He believed it was a "tool
OL,10,Fevery dad should have access to".
